  "rows": [
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "ふむ、これが『例の手紙』……。\n表に『挑戦状』と書かれているな。なになに……",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-3:text",
        "step_id": 3,
        "step_index": 2,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 2
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「トップアイドルを目指す者たちよ。\n今もっともトップに近い者は、誰なのか？」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-4:text",
        "step_id": 4,
        "step_index": 3,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 3
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「今もっとも力を持つアイドル事務所は、\nどこなのか？」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-5:text",
        "step_id": 5,
        "step_index": 4,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 4
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「それを決めるべく、\n『男極ッ！アイドルリーグ』を開催する！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-6:text",
        "step_id": 6,
        "step_index": 5,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 5
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「パフォーマンス部門や体力部門など、\nさまざまな部門で力を競い合うがいい」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-7:text",
        "step_id": 7,
        "step_index": 6,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 6
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「選ばれた1つの事務所には、トップの座に\n近いとして『男極KING』の称号を贈ろう！」",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-8:text",
        "step_id": 8,
        "step_index": 7,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 7
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "「最近話題の新顔事務所、315プロダクションよ。\nお前たちの挑戦を待っている！」……なるほど。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-9:text",
        "step_id": 9,
        "step_index": 8,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 8
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "これはトップアイドルを目指す彼らにとって、\n自身の実力を試すまたとないチャンスになるだろう。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-10:text",
        "step_id": 10,
        "step_index": 9,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 9
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "それでは……。",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-11:text",
        "step_id": 11,
        "step_index": 10,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 10
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "もちろん！　この『男極ッ！アイドルリーグ』\nとやら、受けて立とうではないか！！",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "named",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "齋藤社長"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": true,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-12:text",
        "step_id": 12,
        "step_index": 11,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
        "command_end": null,
        "playback": {
          "file": "episodes/1_4_002_01_b.json",
          "start_step_index": 0,
          "end_step_index": 20,
          "target_step_index": 11
        }
      },
      "option": null
    },
    {
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "source_text": "（なんだか大変なことになったなぁ……）",
      "text_ref": null,
      "speaker": {
        "kind": "producer",
        "entityType": null,
        "entityId": null,
        "sourceName": "<P>"
      },
      "inline_translation": null,
      "has_voice": false,
      "anchor": {
        "row_id": "1_4_002_01_b:step-17:text",
        "step_id": 17,
        "step_index": 16,
        "source_part_id": "1_4_002_01_b",
        "source_file": null,
        "command_start": null,
